{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Your Wall is a meditative wall-breaking experience where you tap through emotional blocks and reveal short quotes of insight, clarity, and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each tap, you crack the surface of the wall and a little more of yourself. Whether you\u2019re feeling happy, gloomy, angry, or just curious, the game responds to your mood with a personalized moment of reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the wall crumble and let powerful words shine through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your favorite breakthrough messages with the in-game camera feature and return to them anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scores, no stress\u2014just a few mindful minutes to breathe, reset, and feel a little more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mood and break your wall with purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to release tension and feel the wall give way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get inspired by encouraging and original quotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorites with one tap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to soothe with clean visuals and calming sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the wall. Feel lighter. Break the wall. Discover what\u2019s behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your space to pause, reflect, and become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a small crack is all you need to move forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924600?t=1758514241","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924600?t=1758514241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924600/e08cc4608b9d9619a7d58040940f055f1c6ef1da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758514241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924600/e08cc4608b9d9619a7d58040940f055f1c6ef1da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758514241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Your Wall is a meditative wall-breaking experience where you tap through emotional blocks and reveal short quotes of insight, clarity, and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each tap, you crack the surface of the wall and a little more of yourself. Whether you\u2019re feeling happy, gloomy, angry, or just curious, the game responds to your mood with a personalized moment of reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the wall crumble and let powerful words shine through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your favorite breakthrough messages with the in-game camera feature and return to them anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scores, no stress\u2014just a few mindful minutes to breathe, reset, and feel a little more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mood and break your wall with purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to release tension and feel the wall give way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get inspired by encouraging and original quotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorites with one tap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to soothe with clean visuals and calming sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the wall. Feel lighter. Break the wall. Discover what\u2019s behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your space to pause, reflect, and become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a small crack is all you need to move forward.</p>","developers":["Yosul Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst